    <questNameRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>questName->The Vault That Sleeps: Umbra</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </questNameRules>
    <questDescriptionRules>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>questDescription->The deepest of them, the coldest, the farthest from any road - a vault in the Umbra that neither held nor fell. It froze. The reading gives its place; the ship, which has been quiet about this one, gives the rest: there are people in it.

The Forsaken put their children in the cold when they knew they were losing. The vault has no power. It cannot be woken until you bring it fire - a persona core, fed into the heart of the place, and there is no taking it back out.

Wake them. Or take what is theirs. Or leave the door shut. The ship will remember which.</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </questDescriptionRules>

    <root Class="QuestNode_Sequence">
